### [1] 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8081/api/members/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test2@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

###

### [2] 로그인 (토큰 발급)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

###

### [3] 게시글 작성
POST http://localhost:8081/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "placeId": 1,
  "title": "테스트 게시글2",
  "content": "테스트 내용입니다2"
}

###

### [4] 게시글 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8081/api/posts

###

### [5] 게시글 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8081/api/posts/2

###

### [6] 좋아요 토글 (memberId=1, postId=1)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/posts/1/likes?memberId=1

###

### [7] 좋아요 다시 토글 (취소)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/posts/1/likes?memberId=1

###

### [8] 좋아요 토글 (다른 멤버)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/posts/1/likes?memberId=2

###

### [9] 게시글 수정
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "placeId": 1,
  "title": "수정된 제목",
  "content": "수정된 내용"
}

###

### [10] 게시글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/posts/1

###

### [존재하지 않는 게시글 좋아요 - 404 예상]
POST http://localhost:8081/api/posts/9999/likes?memberId=1
